# Database dumps / backups — may contain live user rows (encrypted NWC URIs,
# claimant pubkeys). Never commit; restore from the Railway backup instead.
*.dump
*.sql.gz
*.backup
*-backup-*.sql
# NOTE: drizzle/ (generated migrations) is NOT ignored — migrations must be
# committed so production deploys can run `drizzle-kit migrate`.

